(21,'ar','اتصل',1,1,'اتصل','Get in touch with the LinkeFly support and engineering team','اتصل','<p class=\"lead\">Have a question about one of our 150+ free web tools? Want to report a technical issue, suggest a new feature, or discuss advertising and partnerships? We would love to hear from you.</p><p>Please fill out the contact form below or reach out directly to our support team at <a href=\"mailto:support@linkefly.xyz\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary\">support@linkefly.xyz</a>. We typically respond within 24 to 48 business hours.</p>',3,NULL,'2026-10-04 05:28:34'),
