are not limited to:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Attempting to disrupt or overload our infrastructure via automated scripts, scrapers, or Denial-of-Service (DDoS) attacks.</li>\n    <li>Using our tools to generate malicious code, phishing content, or deceptive software payloads.</li>\n    <li>Circumventing any security mechanisms, rate limiters, or technical safeguards established on the platform.</li>\n    <li>Attempting unauthorized access to our backend servers, databases, or hosting systems.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>4. Intellectual Property & User Ownership</h3>\n<p><strong>Your Content Remains Yours:</strong> Any code, text, documents, or images you paste into or upload through LinkeFly remain your exclusive intellectual property. LinkeFly claims zero ownership or licensing rights over your submitted data.</p>\n<p><strong>LinkeFly Assets:</strong> The website design, layout, brand name, logos, original editorial articles, and custom software architecture are the intellectual property of LinkeFly and protected by international copyright laws.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>\n<p>All tools, articles, and services on LinkeFly are provided strictly on an <strong>\"AS IS\" and \"AS AVAILABLE\"</strong> basis, without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. While we strive for maximum accuracy, LinkeFly does not warrant that tool outputs, conversions, calculations, or cryptographic operations are 100% error-free or uninterrupted.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>6. Limitation of Liability</h3>\n<p>Under no circumstances shall LinkeFly, its creators, or administrators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use our tools, including but not limited to loss of data, lost profits, or business interruption.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>7. Governing Law</h3>\n<p>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable general law, without giving effect to any principles of conflicts of law.</p>\n\n<div class=\"card bg-light p-3 mt-4\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-muted small\"><strong>Questions?</strong> For inquiries regarding these terms, please contact our team via <a href=\"/contact\">our Contact Page</a>.</p>\n</div>\n',554,'2026-10-04 05:28:34','2026-10-04 05:28:34'),
(1721,'en','About LinkeFly',1,1,'About LinkeFly','Empowering developers, digital creators, and students with fast, free, and accessible web tools.','Learn about the mission, values, and engineering behind LinkeFly: a complete suite of 150+ free, fast, and privacy-respecting online developer and content utilities.','\n<p class=\"lead\"><strong>LinkeFly</strong> is a premier destination for fast, reliable, and 100% free online web tools. We believe that daily digital utilities&mdash;whether formatting complex JSON, calculating e-commerce fees, generating clean SEO slugs, or converting image formats&mdash;should be instantly accessible without software bloat, sign-ups, or subscriptions.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>Our Story & Mission</h3>\n<p>LinkeFly was born out of frustration with existing tool websites that force users through aggressive paywalls, require intrusive personal information, or clutter the screen with overwhelming pop-ups. We asked a simple question: <em>\"Why can\'t online utilities be clean, lightning-fast, and completely respectful of user privacy?\"</em></p>\n<p>Our mission is to empower developers, digital marketers, graphic designers, copywriters, and students with an enterprise-grade toolkit that works reliably on any device, anywhere in the world.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>What We Offer</h3>\n<p>With over 150 dedicated online utilities, LinkeFly provides solutions across critical digital disciplines:</p>\n\n<div class=\"row g-3 my-3\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n        <div class=\"card p-3 border-primary h-100 bg-white\">\n            <h5 class=\"text-primary fw-bold\"><i class=\"ti ti-code\"></i> Developer & Code Utilities</h5>\n            <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Clean and optimize production code with HTML, CSS, and JS minifiers, pretty-print and validate JSON payloads, encode and decode Base64 data, and obfuscate scripts.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n        <div class=\"card p-3 border-primary h-100 bg-white\">\n            <h5 class=\"text-primary fw-bold\"><i class=\"ti ti-typography\"></i> Text & SEO Content Tools</h5>\n            <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Generate search-engine-friendly URL slugs, count words and characters in real time, transform typography casing (camelCase, snake_case), and remove redundant line breaks.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n        <div class=\"card p-3 border-primary h-100 bg-white\">\n            <h5 class=\"text-primary fw-bold\"><i class=\"ti ti-photo\"></i> Image & Media Converters</h5>\n            <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Boost Core Web Vitals by converting bulky PNG and JPG files into modern, lightweight WebP formats, generating favicons (ICO), and resizing graphics effortlessly.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n        <div class=\"card p-3 border-primary h-100 bg-white\">\n            <h5 class=\"text-primary fw-bold\"><i class=\"ti ti-calculator\"></i> Calculators & Converters</h5>\n            <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Compute merchant payout margins with Stripe and PayPal fee calculators, perform GST and sales tax estimations, and convert hundreds of measurement units.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>Our Core Pillars</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>100% Free Forever:</strong> No premium tiers, no credit cards, no trial periods. Every tool is unrestricted.</li>\n    <li><strong>Privacy-First Architecture:</strong> We prioritize client-side execution in your browser. We never log or harvest your private data, documents, or source code.</li>\n    <li><strong>Speed & Simplicity:</strong> Clean, responsive user interfaces built on modern web standards that load instantly on desktop and mobile.</li>\n    <li><strong>Editorial Excellence:</strong> Our technical guides and blog articles are crafted by experienced developers to deliver actionable, verified knowledge.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>Connect With Us</h3>\n<p>We are constantly expanding our toolkit with new utilities based on user feedback. Have a suggestion for a tool you\'d like to see added? Found a bug? We would love to hear from you!</p>\n<p>Visit our <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary\">Contact Page</a> or submit feedback directly through our <a href=\"/report\" class=\"fw-bold text-primary\">Issue Reporter</a>.</p>\n',555,'2026-10-04 05:28:34','2026-10-04 05:28:34'),
