(1731,'en','Disclaimer',1,1,'Disclaimer','Important legal and operational disclosures regarding tool calculations and informational content.','Our official disclaimer explains the informational nature of calculations, unit conversions, financial calculators, and external links provided on LinkeFly.','\n<p class=\"lead\">The information and tools provided by <strong>LinkeFly</strong> (<a href=\"https://linkefly.xyz/\">https://linkefly.xyz/</a>) are for general informational, educational, and workflow assistance purposes only. All utilities and content are published in good faith.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>1. Calculation & Conversion Accuracy</h3>\n<p>While LinkeFly makes every effort to ensure that our mathematical calculators (such as PayPal fee calculators, Stripe fee calculators, GST calculators, and loan calculators) and unit conversion tools operate with high precision, <strong>we make no guarantees or warranties of absolute financial, mathematical, or regulatory accuracy</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Third-party payment gateways (like Stripe or PayPal) frequently adjust their regional interchange rates, currency conversion markups, and cross-border surcharges.</li>\n    <li>Calculations provided by LinkeFly should be treated as estimations and <strong>never as certified accounting, tax, or legal advice</strong>.</li>\n    <li>Always verify critical commercial billing figures with your financial institution or certified accountant before making commercial commitments.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>2. Cryptographic Hashes & Security Tools</h3>\n<p>Tools such as our MD5 Generator, Password Generator, and Base64 Encoder are provided for testing, debugging, and file checksum verification. Please note:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>MD5 is a legacy hashing algorithm susceptible to collision vulnerabilities; it should not be used for high-security password hashing in production cryptographic applications.</li>\n    <li>While our password generator creates high-entropy strings, the overall security of your digital accounts depends on multi-factor authentication and prudent password hygiene.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>3. External Links & Advertisements</h3>\n<p>LinkeFly may contain links to external third-party websites or display automated advertisements via Google AdSense and third-party advertising partners. Such external links and advertisements are not investigated, monitored, or endorsed by LinkeFly.</p>\n<p>We have no control over the content, privacy practices, or accuracy of third-party websites. When you click an external link, you do so entirely at your own discretion.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\">\n\n<h3>4. Limitation of Liability</h3>\n<p>In no event shall LinkeFly or its operators be liable for any loss, damage, or legal consequences arising directly or indirectly from the use of our online tools, reliance on information presented, or technical interruptions.</p>\n\n<div class=\"card bg-light p-3 mt-4\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-muted small\"><strong>Contact:</strong> For questions concerning this disclaimer, please reach out via <a href=\"/contact\">our Contact Page</a>.</p>\n</div>\n',556,'2026-10-04 05:28:34','2026-10-04 05:28:34'),
